{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"arguments\":[{\"argument_id\":\"arg.scope\",\"candidate_id\":\"node.a3bfe36da58bc7bb188e00cb\",\"conclusion\":{\"atom\":\"covered_option_exemption_conditions\",\"negative\":false},\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”)\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"},{\"quote\":\"from 4 January 2026 until further notice\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"}],\"inference\":\"The announcement expressly identifies the covered instrument categories and commencement period.\",\"inference_id\":\"inf.scope\",\"inference_kind\":\"STRICT\",\"parents\":[],\"premises\":[{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”)\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"}],\"explanation\":\"The circular defines the listed non-centrally cleared equity-option categories.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.scope.products\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"listed_non_centrally_cleared_equity_options_defined\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"},{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"from 4 January 2026 until further notice\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"}],\"explanation\":\"The circular states the exemption period.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.scope.time\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"exemption_period_starts_2026_01_04_and_continues_until_further_notice\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}]},{\"argument_id\":\"arg.applicability\",\"candidate_id\":\"node.a3bfe36da58bc7bb188e00cb\",\"conclusion\":{\"atom\":\"exemption_applies\",\"negative\":false},\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"issues this circular to inform licensed corporations\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"},{\"quote\":\"As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671\"}],\"inference\":\"Within the stated actor and underlying margin-regime scope, the listed product, non-central-clearing and date conditions support applicability while no effective later notice displaces the announcement.\",\"inference_id\":\"inf.applicability\",\"inference_kind\":\"DEFEASIBLE\",\"parents\":[\"arg.scope\"],\"premises\":[{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"issues this circular to inform licensed corporations\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"}],\"explanation\":\"The addressed population is licensed corporations.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.app.actor\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"actor_is_licensed_corporation\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"},{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671\"}],\"explanation\":\"The referenced margin requirements are in Part III of Schedule 10.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.app.regime\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"requirement_within_schedule_10_part_iii\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"},{\"evidence\":[],\"explanation\":\"The assessed transaction is in a listed category, is non-centrally cleared, is assessed on or after 2026-01-04, and no effective later notice displaces the announcement.\",\"kind\":\"ASSUMPTION\",\"premise_id\":\"p.app.factual_conditions\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"product_clearing_date_and_continuation_conditions_hold\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"QUESTIONED\"}]},{\"argument_id\":\"arg.gazettal\",\"candidate_id\":\"node.362f5626ec7d4ad1bac35f32\",\"conclusion\":{\"atom\":\"exemption_applies\",\"negative\":true},\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357\"}],\"inference\":\"If gazettal is constitutive, the circular alone does not make the exemption operative before that event.\",\"inference_id\":\"inf.gazettal\",\"inference_kind\":\"DEFEASIBLE\",\"parents\":[],\"premises\":[{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357\"}],\"explanation\":\"The circular announces a future amendment and gazettal.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.gazettal.pending\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"code_amendment_and_gazettal_are_pending\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"},{\"evidence\":[],\"explanation\":\"Gazettal is legally constitutive of the exemption's operative effect.\",\"kind\":\"ASSUMPTION\",\"premise_id\":\"p.gazettal.constitutive\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"gazettal_required_before_operativity\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"QUESTIONED\"}]},{\"argument_id\":\"arg.eu_conditions\",\"candidate_id\":\"node.a3bfe36da58bc7bb188e00cb\",\"conclusion\":{\"atom\":\"sfc_exemption_requires_eu_reporting\",\"negative\":true},\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"In the EU, a permanent exemption from the requirement to exchange margin for single-stock equity options and equity index options became effective on 24 December 2024, subject to monitoring and periodic reporting2.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u3.801\"}],\"inference\":\"The EU monitoring and reporting qualification is expressly attached to the EU exemption and is not stated as an SFC condition.\",\"inference_id\":\"inf.eu-separation\",\"inference_kind\":\"DEFEASIBLE\",\"parents\":[\"arg.applicability\"],\"premises\":[{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"subject to monitoring and periodic reporting2.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u3.801\"}],\"explanation\":\"The reporting language qualifies the EU exemption described in that sentence.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.eu.reporting\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"eu_exemption_subject_to_reporting\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}]},{\"argument_id\":\"arg.exposure_threshold\",\"candidate_id\":\"node.a3bfe36da58bc7bb188e00cb\",\"conclusion\":{\"atom\":\"individual_exposure_threshold_required\",\"negative\":true},\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"licensed corporations’ exposures to non-centrally cleared equity options are currently insignificant\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u1.381\"}],\"inference\":\"The insignificant-exposure statement explains policy alignment and does not state an individual eligibility threshold.\",\"inference_id\":\"inf.exposure\",\"inference_kind\":\"DEFEASIBLE\",\"parents\":[\"arg.applicability\"],\"premises\":[{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"licensed corporations’ exposures to non-centrally cleared equity options are currently insignificant\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u1.381\"}],\"explanation\":\"The source describes aggregate current exposures.\",\"kind\":\"ORDINARY\",\"premise_id\":\"p.exposure.rationale\",\"proposition\":{\"atom\":\"insignificant_exposure_is_policy_rationale\",\"negative\":false},\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}]}],\"attacks\":[{\"attacker\":\"arg.gazettal\",\"kind\":\"UNDERCUT\",\"rationale\":\"The constitutive-gazettal inference is an unresolved legal assumption; the circular separately states exemption from 4 January 2026 and does not expressly make gazettal a condition precedent.\",\"target\":\"arg.applicability\",\"target_component\":\"inf.applicability\"},{\"attacker\":\"arg.applicability\",\"kind\":\"UNDERMINE\",\"rationale\":\"The packet does not establish the assessed corporation's licensing status, the underlying Schedule 10 applicability, product classification, clearing status, assessment date, or absence of a later displacing notice.\",\"target\":\"arg.applicability\",\"target_component\":\"p.app.factual_conditions\"},{\"attacker\":\"arg.gazettal\",\"kind\":\"REBUT\",\"rationale\":\"A later amendment could specify a commencement rule or transitional treatment inconsistent with the announced-operational reading.\",\"target\":\"arg.applicability\",\"target_component\":\"arg.applicability\"}],\"case_queries\":[],\"cases\":[],\"preferences\":[{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"from 4 January 2026 until further notice\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"},{\"quote\":\"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357\"}],\"over\":\"arg.gazettal\",\"preferred\":\"arg.applicability\",\"rationale\":\"The express commencement date and until-further-notice language support announced applicability, while the legal effect of pending gazettal remains unresolved; preference is provisional.\"}],\"questions\":[\"What do the underlying Schedule 10 provisions provide about covered corporations, products and transitional treatment?\",\"Has a later SFC notice or gazetted amendment taken effect for the assessment date?\",\"Is gazettal constitutive of exemption effect or a formal implementation step?\"]}"}}
